WEBVTT

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:26.570
I guess they'll all be heading out soon...

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:30.920
Yes?

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:33.420
Ruki-kun.

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:35.940
Change.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:41.680
A school uniform?

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.560
I'm allowed to go to school?

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:48.060
Um...

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:50.600
Hurry up.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:04.240
I can really go?

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.770
See ya later, masochistic kitten.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.430
O-Okay.

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:29.910
Reiji-san!

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:34.550
I was wondering where you disappeared to.

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:38.710
Now I see...

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:43.680
U-Um, I'm sorry I couldn't keep in touch.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:46.490
These people named Mukami took me—

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:50.610
I don't have the slightest interest in

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.730
where you are and who you're with.

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:58.400
Little Bitch, you're so cruel.

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:00.740
Raito-kun...

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:05.860
You tossed us aside to go 
and have fun with them?

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:08.520
And of all things...

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:13.540
You're with those guys who I'm not 
entirely convinced are real vampires.

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.530
Inconceivable.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:16.870
Kanato-kun...

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.590
I'm very displeased.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.610
I-I'm sorry...

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:28.390
Well, somebody has been looking 
for Little Bitch all this time.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.840
You're talking about Ayato?

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:35.220
Yep.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:41.070
Though, Ayato didn't come to school today.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.400
Oh, yeah. He ditched.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:46.460
Lucky you, Little Bitch.

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:50.490
Ayato-kun isn't here... today?

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:17.140
You're in my way, you stupid NEET.

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:20.790
I said move!

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:28.900
I can sit here if I want to.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.100
What?

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:43.250
If you want to pass, just pass.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:09.360
Hey, Kou-kun. I saw your show yesterday!

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.280
Really? Thanks.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:12.400
Me, too.

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:14.030
You were so handsome!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.870
It was like you were shining!

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:21.070
Hey, Kou, why don't you 
come over my place today?

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:24.500
Kou-kun really is famous...

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:31.050
S-Subaru-kun?

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:33.550
Um... Ouch!

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.120
Come.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.160
W-Wait!

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.590
You're hurting me, Subaru-kun!

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:00.250
Is it your own will?

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:06.250
Was it your own choice to live with them?

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.000
Answer me.

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:11.250
W-Well...

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:13.920
I, um...

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:21.850
You can't even answer?

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.230
Why don't you answer him, masochistic kitten?

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:33.360
Kou-kun?

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:41.980
You want her back?

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:45.870
You're mad because your 
food was taken away, right?

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:47.160
Y-You...

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:49.200
Oh, I get it.

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:52.420
You like her, don't you?

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.180
Don't play with me.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:01.380
Be honest with yourself, Subaru-kun.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:08.690
If you want her, just take her with you now.

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:14.020
I guess you don't want her.

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:18.700
Then I'll gladly take her. 
Let's go, masochistic kitten.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:31.440
Subaru-kun, stop...

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:39.400
You should've done that in 
the first place, Subaru-kun.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.480
This is stupid...

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:00.980
Subaru-kun...

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.040
Oh, dear...

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:10.420
Look at the mess he made on 
the masochistic kitten's neck.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:17.050
Don't worry. I'll disinfect it for you.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:43.020
I'll suck so deeply, you won't even be able to tell

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.440
that this was Subaru-kun's bite mark.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.900
Stop!

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:15.640
I won't let them have you...

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.230
I can't quench this thirst...

00:12:23.770 --> 00:12:27.480
I want it so bad, I'd even 
destroy it to make it mine.

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.140
Why does it have to be you?

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:34.590
In the solitude of darkness, 
I'll devour you completely.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:39.530
So annoying... Shut up 
so I can suck your blood.
